---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../assets/portrait.jpg';
---

<section class="section about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="wrap about__intro">
    <h2 class="label about__label" id="about-title">About</h2>
    <p class="about__text" data-words>
      I think like a lawyer and build like a designer. I studied law at the University of Ghana School of Law, class of
      2026, and I live in Accra. Alongside the law I design interfaces in Figma and build apps with AI, so I rarely stay
      on one side of the table. The work I care about needs both.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap about__grid">
    <figure class="about__figure" data-reveal>
      <div class="about__frame" data-parallax>
        <Picture
          src={portrait}
          formats={['webp']}
          widths={[480, 720, 960, 1280, portrait.width]}
          sizes="(min-width: 900px) 42vw, 92vw"
          alt="Clinton Tano seated in a wooden armchair in a warm study, wearing a brown pinstripe double-breasted suit. Shelves behind him hold books, a statue of Lady Justice, a gavel, a globe and an hourglass."
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          quality={60}
        />
      </div>
      <figcaption class="about__caption eyebrow">
        <span>Fig. 01</span>
        <span>Clinton Tano, Accra</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="about__side">
      <p class="about__lede" data-reveal>
        Today that means Decidendi, which I founded to test how well AI models handle legal reasoning, with practising
        legal experts doing the judging.
      </p>
      <p class="about__more" data-reveal style="--delay: 0.1s">
        Before it, I worked on RoomBerl and Lorryfare. One helps students find the right roommate. The other tells you
        when the next trotro is arriving.
      </p>

      <dl class="about__facts" data-reveal style="--delay: 0.2s">
        <div>
          <dt class="eyebrow">Based</dt>
          <dd>Accra, Ghana</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="eyebrow">Studied</dt>
          <dd>University of Ghana School of Law, class of 2026</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="eyebrow">Now</dt>
          <dd>Founder, Decidendi</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="eyebrow">Tools</dt>
          <dd>Figma, and AI for the build</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about__intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(150px, 1fr) minmax(0, 3.2fr);
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .about__label {
    align-self: start;
    padding-top: 0.9em;
  }

  .about__text {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4.1vw, 66px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .about__text :global(.w) {
    opacity: 0.14;
    transition: opacity 0.5s var(--ease-out);
  }

  .about__text :global(.w.is-on) {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 6fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 110px);
    align-items: end;
    margin-top: clamp(64px, 9vw, 140px);
    padding-top: clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }

  .about__frame {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 1482 / 2000;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--paper-3);
  }

  .about__frame :global(picture) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  /* Black and white until it is on screen, then the colour blooms in. */
  .about__frame :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    height: 110%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 50% 30%;
    transform: translate3d(0, calc(var(--parallax, 0) * -9%), 0);
    will-change: transform;
  }

  :global(.js) .about__frame :global(img) {
    filter: grayscale(1) contrast(1.05);
    transition: filter 1.8s var(--ease-out) 0.35s;
  }

  :global(.js) .about__figure.is-in .about__frame :global(img) {
    filter: none;
  }

  .about__caption {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-top: 14px;
    color: var(--grey);
  }

  .about__lede {
    max-width: 22ch;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(30px, 3vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .about__more {
    max-width: 44ch;
    margin-top: 22px;
    color: var(--grey);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .about__facts {
    margin-top: clamp(36px, 5vw, 72px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }

  .about__facts > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .about__facts dt {
    color: var(--grey);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about__intro {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .about__label {
      padding-top: 0;
    }

    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .about__facts > div {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 4px;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .about__frame :global(img),
    :global(.js) .about__frame :global(img) {
      height: 100%;
      transform: none;
      filter: none;
    }
  }
</style>
